(1. Purpose) Tj
T*
(Provide an engineering conclusion on the most probable root cause of ESP failure) Tj
T*
(and a defensible position for the operating organization.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Input data and analysis limits) Tj
T*
(2.1 Repository contains R1.rar \(RAR5 format\).) Tj
T*
(2.2 Direct extraction of inner files in current environment is limited) Tj
T*
(\(no unrar/7z available; package install blocked by proxy policy\).) Tj
T*
(2.3 RAR5 header parsing was performed to identify actual document set.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Confirmed content of the archive \(from RAR5 headers\)) Tj
T*
(- Extended fluid chemistry analysis \(.xlsx\)) Tj
T*
(- Electrical protocol page \(.pdf\)) Tj
T*
(- Log_result.xlsx) Tj
T*
