(7.2 Operator fault requires full causal chain:) Tj
T*
(operator action -> measured mode deviation -> matching physical damage mechanism.) Tj
T*
(7.3 Without this chain, operator liability is not proven.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(8. Defense position for operating organization) Tj
T*
(- Classify event as likely caused by external well factors and/or sizing limitations.) Tj
T*
(- Require independent technical examination and telemetry-vs-mode-map correlation.) Tj
T*
(- Reject statements like "operator fault by failure fact only" as methodologically invalid.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(9. Evidence checklist for final conclusion) Tj
T*
(1\) 72h pre-failure trends: current, voltage, frequency, temperature, pressure, rate.) Tj
T*
(2\) Mode map and real operation inside allowable windows.) Tj
T*
(3\) Disassembly/defect report with photo evidence and independent expert.) Tj
T*
(4\) Fluid chemistry dynamics and solids trend.) Tj
T*
(5\) Runtime to failure versus warranty/normative values.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(10. Recommended structure of a professional engineer report) Tj
T*
(Section 1: Asset passport and commission.) Tj
T*
(Section 2: Timeline with exact timestamps.) Tj
T*
(Section 3: Parameter trends \(tables, charts, event marks\).) Tj
T*
(Section 4: Defect findings \(components, wear, scoring, cracks\).) Tj
T*
(Section 5: Medium analysis and failure correlation.) Tj
T*
(Section 6: Hypothesis comparison with probability ranking.) Tj
T*
(Section 7: Root cause and preventive actions.) Tj
T*
(Section 8: Liability and risk allocation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(11. Preventive actions) Tj
T*
(- Strengthen medium-quality surveillance \(chemistry, solids, gas factor\).) Tj
T*
(- Implement automatic protections by VFD/current/temperature trend thresholds.) Tj
T*
(- Re-validate ESP sizing and operation windows for actual production profile.) Tj
T*
(- Add mandatory post-failure review matrix: damage mechanism <-> root cause.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(12. Final conclusion) Tj
T*
(Based on available materials, the most probable root cause is external) Tj
T*
(well-condition influence causing off-design ESP operation.) Tj
T*
(Direct proven operator fault is currently not established.) Tj
T*
(Final confirmation requires decoded content of failure report, logs, and defect records.) Tj
